title: $:/plugins/rimir/json-dsl/test/test-emit-out-of-context
description: json-emit outside a json-obj/json-array context emits literal null
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki-multiple
tags: [[$:/tags/wiki-test-spec]]

title: Output

\whitespace trim
<$json-emit indent="0"/>
+
title: ExpectedResult

<p>null</p>
+
title: Narrative

When `$json-emit` is rendered with no enclosing json-builder context (no parent `$json-obj` or `$json-array`), it must produce a valid JSON literal — `null` — instead of crashing or emitting an empty string.
